  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nLogic: **(Cube of 1st number) × 3 - 2 = 2nd number.**\n\nNow,\n\n6 : 646\n\n→ 6³ × 3 - 2\n\n→ 216 × 3 - 2\n\n→ 648 - 2 = 646.\n\n4 : 190\n\n→ 43 × 3 - 2\n\n→ 64 × 3 - 2\n\n→ 192 - 2 = 190.\n\nSimilarly,** 5 : ?**\n\n**→ 53 × 3 - 2**\n\n**→ 125 × 3 - 2**\n\n**→ 375 - 2 = 373.**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"373\"**.\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] **__Alternate Method__**\n\n**Logic :** (Cube of 1st number) × 3 = 2nd number + 2\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• 6 : 646\n\n(6)³ × 3 = **646 + 2**__\n\n__**216 × 3**__ = 648\n\n648 = 648 (LHS = RHS)\n\nAnd,\n\n__\n \n• 4 : 190\n\n(4)³ × 3 = **190** + 2__\n\n__64 × 3__ = 192\n\n192 = 192 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n__\n \n• 5 : ?\n\n(5)³ × 3 = ? + 2\n\n**125 × 3**__ - 2 = ?\n\n__**375 - 2**__ = ?\n\n**373 = ?**\n\nHence, **\"373\"** is the correct answer.",
